{"title":"Rimeworm Tooth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Rimeworm Hatchling, Rimeworm</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rimeworm\" title=\"Rimeworm - dropped it in 9 of 10 looted corpses (1/1.1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/b58be774f63a069d3cdc.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimeworm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rimeworm-hatchling\" title=\"Rimeworm Hatchling - dropped it in 11 of 13 looted corpses (1/1.2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4b7130737a79374e071c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimeworm Hatchling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–4</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"rimeworm-tooth\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/491f87c5a54171330506.svg\" alt=\"Rimeworm Tooth\"></div><h3>Rimeworm Tooth</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/6/2026, 3:15:09 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}